    --- Sets the anchor points that determine where the mouse interacts with the nameplate.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `anchors`: List of anchor points to use for hit testing. All existing points will be cleared.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_NamePlate_SetHitTestPoints)
    function SetHitTestPoints(anchors: AnchorBinding[])
    --- Sets the frame whose bounds the nameplate uses when nameplates stack to avoid overlapping.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_NamePlate_SetStackingBoundsFrame)
    function SetStackingBoundsFrame(frame: Frame)
end

