    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_Browser_DeleteCookies)
    function DeleteCookies()
    --- Goes back to the previous page.
