    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_Browser_NavigateBack)
    function NavigateBack()
    --- Goes forward to the next page.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_Browser_NavigateForward)
    function NavigateForward()
    --- Opens the browser's home page of the given type.
    ---
