--- - `posBuff`: The total effect of positive buffs to ranged attack power.
--- - `negBuff`: The total effect of negative buffs to the ranged attack power (a negative number)
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitRangedAttackPower)
