--- - `unit`: The unit to get information from. (Likely only works for `"player"` and `"pet"` -- unconfirmed)
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `speed`: The unit's ranged weapon speed (0 if no ranged weapon equipped).
--- - `minDamage`: The unit's minimum ranged damage.
--- - `maxDamage`: The unit's maximum ranged damage.
--- - `posBuff`: The unit's positive Bonus on ranged attacks (includes Spelldamage increases)
--- - `negBuff`: The unit's negative Bonus on ranged attacks
--- - `percent`: percentage modifier (usually 1)
---
