--- Requests information regarding the arena team that the player is in, see Returns for a full list of what this returns.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `index`: Index of the team you want information on, can be a value between 1 and 3.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `teamName`: Teams name, nil if they aren't on a team or the data wasn't received yet.
--- - `teamSize`: Team size (2, 3 or 5)
--- - `teamRating`: Teams rating, for a team that hasn't played any games this season it'll be 1500
--- - `weekPlayed`: Total games the team has played for the current week
--- - `weekWins`: Total games the team has won for the current week
--- - `seasonPlayed`: Total games that the team has played this season
--- - `seasonWins`: Total games that the team has played this season
--- - `playerPlayed`: Total games that the player has played this week
--- - `seasonPlayerPlayed`: Total games that the player has played this season
--- - `teamRank`: Teams current ranking, this is updated once a week typically when points are calculated
--- - `personalRating`: Players personal rating with this team
--- - `background (red)`: Float - Amount of red in the teams banner background
--- - `background (green)`: Float - Amount of green in the teams banner background
--- - `background (blue)`: Float - Amount of blue in the teams banner background
--- - `emblem`: Emblem graphic name
--- - `emblem - (red)`: Float - Amount of red in the teams emblem color
--- - `emblem - (green)`: Float - Amount of green in the teams emblem color
--- - `emblem (blue)`: Float - Amount of blue in the teams emblem color
--- - `border`: Border graphic name
--- - `border (red)`: Float - Amount of red in the teams border color
--- - `border (green)`: Float - Amount of green in the teams border color
--- - `border (blue)`: Float - Amount of blue in the teams border color
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetArenaTeam)
declare function GetArenaTeam(id: unknown): (string?, number, number, number, number, number, number, number, number, number, number)
