--- - `rank`: 0 denotes team captain, while 1 denotes a regular member.
--- - `level`: Player level.
--- - `class`: The localized class of the player.
--- - `online`: 1 denotes the player being online. nil denotes the player as offline.
--- - `played`: Number of games this player has played this week.
--- - `win`: Number of games this player has won this week.
--- - `seasonPlayed`: Number of games played the entire season.
--- - `seasonWin`: Number of games this player has won this week.
--- - `personalRating`: Players personal rating with this team
---
