    --- Returns the IDs of the store front's categories.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_AccountStore.GetCategories)
