    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_AddOns.GetAddOnEnableState)
    function GetAddOnEnableState(name: uiAddon, character: string?): AddOnEnableState
    --- Returns information about an AddOn.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `name`: The name of the addon to be queried, or an index from 1 to `C_AddOns.GetNumAddOns`. The state of Blizzard addons can only be queried by name.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `name`: The name of the AddOn (the folder name).
    --- - `title`: The localized title of the AddOn as listed in the .toc file.
    --- - `notes`: The localized notes about the AddOn from its .toc file.
    --- - `loadable`: Indicates if the AddOn is loaded or eligible to be loaded on this or another character, true if it is, false if it is not.
    --- - `reason`: The reason why the AddOn cannot be loaded. This is nil if the addon is loadable, otherwise it contains a string token indicating the reason that can be localized by prepending "ADDON_".
    --- - `security`: Indicates the security status of the AddOn. This is currently "INSECURE" for all user provided addons, "SECURE_PROTECTED" for guarded Blizzard addons, and "SECURE" for all other Blizzard AddOns.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_AddOns.GetAddOnInfo)
    function GetAddOnInfo(name: uiAddon): (string, string, string, boolean, string, string)
