    --- - `text`: Text to be wrapped in color markup.
    --- - `color`: Color to apply to the text.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `coloredText`: The input text wrapped in '|c' and '|r' quoted code sequences for the supplied color.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ColorUtil.WrapTextInColor)
    function WrapTextInColor(text: string, color: ColorMixin): string
    --- Wraps a given string with color code markup.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `text`: Text to be wrapped in color markup.
    --- - `textColorCode`: Color to apply to the text, formatted as an 8-byte ARGB string as returned by GenerateTextColorCode.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `coloredText`: The input text wrapped in '|c' and '|r' quoted code sequences for the supplied color.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ColorUtil.WrapTextInColorCode)
    function WrapTextInColorCode(text: string, textColorCode: string): string
end

