    --- Returns info for an item.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `itemName`: The localized name of the item.
    --- - `itemLink`: : ItemLink - The localized link of the item.
    --- - `itemQuality`: : Enum.ItemQuality - The quality of the item, e.g. `2` for Uncommon and `3` for Rare quality items.
    --- - `itemLevel`: The base item level, not including upgrades. See `GetDetailedItemLevelInfo`() for getting the actual item level.
    --- - `itemMinLevel`: The minimum level required to use the item, or `0` if there is no level requirement.
    --- - `itemType`: : ItemType - The localized type name of the item: Armor, Weapon, Quest, etc.
    --- - `itemSubType`: : ItemType - The localized sub-type name of the item: Bows, Guns, Staves, etc.
    --- - `itemStackCount`: The max amount of an item per stack, e.g. 200 for Runecloth.
    --- - `itemEquipLoc`: : ItemEquipLoc - The inventory equipment location in which the item may be equipped e.g. `"INVTYPE_HEAD"`, or an empty string if it cannot be equipped.
    --- - `itemTexture`: : FileID - The texture for the item icon.
    --- - `sellPrice`: The vendor price in copper, or `0` for items that cannot be sold.
    --- - `classID`: : ItemType - The numeric ID of `itemType`
    --- - `subclassID`: : ItemType - The numeric ID of `itemSubType`
    --- - `bindType`: : Enum.ItemBind - When the item becomes soulbound, e.g. `1` for Bind on Pickup items.
    --- - `expansionID`: : LE_EXPANSION - The related Expansion, e.g. `8` for Shadowlands. On Classic this appears to be always `254`.
    --- - `setID`: : - For example 761 for Red Winter Hat (itemID 21524).
    --- - `isCraftingReagent`: Whether the item can be used as a crafting reagent.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Item.GetItemInfo)
    function GetItemInfo(itemInfo: ItemInfo): (string?, string?, ItemQuality?, number?, number?, string?, string?, number?, string?, number?, number?, number?, number?, number?, number?, number?, boolean?, string?)
    --- Returns readily available info for an item.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `item`: :
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `itemID`: ID of the item.
    --- - `itemType`: : ItemType - The localized type name of the item: Armor, Weapon, Quest, etc.
    --- - `itemSubType`: : ItemType - The localized sub-type name of the item: Bows, Guns, Staves, etc.
    --- - `itemEquipLoc`: : ItemEquipLoc - The inventory equipment location in which the item may be equipped e.g. `"INVTYPE_HEAD"`, or an empty string if it cannot be equipped.
    --- - `icon`: The texture for the item icon.
    --- - `classID`: : ItemType - The numeric ID of `itemType`
    --- - `subClassID`: : ItemType - The numeric ID of `itemSubType`
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Item.GetItemInfoInstant)
