declare namespace C_PetBattles
    --- Returns the rarity of a specific pet in the current pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `slot`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetBreedQuality)
    function GetBreedQuality(petOwner: BattlePetOwner, slot: number): BattlePetBreedQuality
    --- Returns the current icon of a specific pet in the pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `slot`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetIcon)
    function GetIcon(petOwner: BattlePetOwner, slot: number): number?
    --- Returns the name(s) of a specific pet in the pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `slot`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `customName`: Name of the pet. If the pet has a custom name, it will be returned here. If not, it returns the species name here as well as in the second return.
    --- - `speciesName`: Name of the pet's Species.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetName)
    function GetName(petOwner: BattlePetOwner, slot: number): (string?, string?)
    --- Returns whether or not a pet battle team is controlled by an NPC.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `petOwner`: 1: Current player, 2: Opponent.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `isNPC`: false if the pet owner is a player, true otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.IsPlayerNPC)
    function IsPlayerNPC(): boolean
    --- Returns whether or not there is a wild pet battle in progress.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `inWildBattle`: True if in a wild pet battle, false if not in a wild pet battle or not in a pet battle at all
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.IsWildBattle)
    function IsWildBattle(): boolean
    --- Accepts a pending PvP duel invitation.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.AcceptPVPDuel)
    function AcceptPVPDuel()
    --- Accepts a pending PvP match from the queue.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.AcceptQueuedPVPMatch)
    function AcceptQueuedPVPMatch()
    --- Returns whether the player can currently accept the queued PvP pet battle match.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `canAccept`: true if the player can currently accept the queued PvP pet battle match invitation, false otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.CanAcceptQueuedPVPMatch)
    function CanAcceptQueuedPVPMatch(): boolean
    --- Returns whether or not the active pet can be swapped out in the pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `usable`: True if active pet can swap out, false otherwise
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.CanActivePetSwapOut)
    function CanActivePetSwapOut(): boolean
    --- Returns whether or not the pet can swap in to the active position.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `petIndex`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `usable`: True if the pet is able to swap in, false otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.CanPetSwapIn)
    function CanPetSwapIn(petIndex: number): boolean
    --- Declines a pending PvP pet battle duel invitation.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.CancelPVPDuel)
    function CancelPVPDuel()
    --- Changes the active pet out for a different pet in a pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `petIndex`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.ChangePet)
    function ChangePet(petIndex: number)
    --- Declines a pending PvP match from the queue.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.DeclineQueuedPVPMatch)
    function DeclineQueuedPVPMatch()
    --- Forfeits the current Pet Battle immediately.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.ForfeitGame)
    function ForfeitGame()
    --- Returns the effect info for a pet's ability.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `abilityID`: The ID of this ability.
    --- - `turnIndex`: The turn in question for this ability. This can be obtained from `C_PetBattles.GetAbilityProcTurnIndex`.
    --- - `effectIndex`: The effect in question for this ability. This can be obtained from the unparsed description for this ability with extensive string manipulation, but currently no ability has more than 7 effects, so loops work too.
    --- - `effectName`: One of the effect names from `C_PetBattles.GetAllEffectNames`.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `value`: The information you requested for a specific element of a certain effect of a certain ability at a specific turn.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetAbilityEffectInfo)
    function GetAbilityEffectInfo(abilityID: number, turnIndex: number, effectIndex: number, effectName: string): number
    --- Returns ability information for an ability in a slot on a pet that you own.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `petOwner`: 1: Current player, 2: Opponent
    --- - `petIndex`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    --- - `abilityIndex`: Accepted values are 1-3, corresponding to the ability in the slot with that number.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `id`: The ID of the ability returned back.
    --- - `name`: The name of the ability.
    --- - `icon`: The full path to the ability's icon.
    --- - `maxCooldown`: The normal cooldown period for the ability.
    --- - `unparsedDescription`: The ability's description in its pure and unparsed form.
    --- - `numTurns`: Duration of the ability. This is typically 1, but some abilities last multiple rounds.
    --- - `petType`: Returned values are 1-10, based on the pet's type.
    --- - `noStrongWeakHints`: True if the ability should not show Strong/Weak indicators, false otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetAbilityInfo)
    function GetAbilityInfo(petOwner: number, petIndex: number, abilityIndex: number): (number, string, string, number, string, number, number, boolean)
    --- Returns very detailed information about a specific ability.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `id`: ID of the ability.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `id`: The ID of the ability returned back.
    --- - `name`: The name of the ability.
    --- - `icon`: The full path to the ability's icon.
    --- - `maxCooldown`: The normal cooldown period for the ability.
    --- - `unparsedDescription`: The ability's description in its pure and unparsed form.
    --- - `numTurns`: Duration of the ability. This is typically 1, but some abilities last multiple rounds.
    --- - `petType`: Returned values are 1-10, based on the
    --- - `noStrongWeakHints`: True if the ability should not show Strong/Weak indicators, false otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetAbilityInfoByID)
    function GetAbilityInfoByID(id: number): (number, string, string, number, string, number, number, boolean)
    --- Returns the turn index for a specific ability and proc type.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `abilityID`: ID of the ability.
    --- - `procType`: Index corresponding to a proc type.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `turnIndex`: Number of rounds that the ability has been in play.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_PetBattles.GetAbilityProcTurnIndex)
    function GetAbilityProcTurnIndex(abilityID: number, procType: number): number
    --- Returns information about a pet's ability's current state in the pet battle.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `petOwner`: 1: Current player, 2: Opponent
    --- - `petIndex`: Accepted values are 1-3, but the order is based off of the initial order. Which pet is currently active is irrelevant to the index, if it was your 3rd pet when you entered battle, it will always be 3 on the index.
    --- - `actionIndex`: Accepted values are 1-3, corresponding to the ability buttons from left to right.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
