declare namespace C_Reputation
    --- Returns Paragon info on a faction.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `factionID`: : FactionID
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `currentValue`: The amount of reputation you have earned in the current level of Paragon.
    --- - `threshold`: The amount of reputation until you gain the next Paragon level.
    --- - `rewardQuestID`: The ID of the quest once you attain a new Paragon level (or your first).
    --- - `hasRewardPending`: True if the player has attained a Paragon level but has not completed the reward quest.
    --- - `tooLowLevelForParagon`: True if the player level is too low to complete the Paragon reward quest.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Reputation.GetFactionParagonInfo)
    function GetFactionParagonInfo(factionID: number): (number?, number?, number?, boolean?, boolean?, number?)
