    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Reputation.GetGuildFactionData)
    function GetGuildFactionData(): FactionData?
    --- Returns the data of the faction watched on the reputation bar, or nil when none is watched.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Reputation.GetWatchedFactionData)
