    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Reputation.IsAccountWideReputation)
    function IsAccountWideReputation(factionID: number): boolean
    --- Returns true if a faction is a paragon reputation.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `factionID`: The factionID from the 14th return of GetFactionInfo or the 6th return from GetWatchedFactionInfo.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `factionIsParagon`: true if the faction is Paragon level, false otherwise.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Reputation.IsFactionParagon)
    function IsFactionParagon(factionID: number): boolean
    --- Whether the given faction has paragon reputation for the player.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Reputation.IsFactionParagonForCurrentPlayer)
