declare namespace C_Spell
    --- Cancels the given spell.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.CancelSpellByID)
    function CancelSpellByID(spellID: number)
    --- Whether the given spell exists.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellIdentifier`: Using name will always check for an override on that spell
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.DoesSpellExist)
    function DoesSpellExist(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Used in conjunction with SpellRangeCheckUpdate to inform the UI when a spell goes in or out of range with the current target.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `enable`: True if changes in range for the spell should dispatch SpellRangeCheckUpdate. False if the spell no longer needs the event.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.EnableSpellRangeCheck)
    function EnableSpellRangeCheck(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier, enable: boolean)
    --- Returns the display name of the given spell school mask, such as "Fire".
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `schoolMask`: A bit mask of spell schools.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSchoolString)
    function GetSchoolString(schoolMask: number): string
    --- Returns number of times a spell can be cast, typically based on availability of things like required reagent items; Returns 0 if spell is not found
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellCastCount)
    function GetSpellCastCount(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): number
    --- Returns a duration object describing the active recharge time for a spell.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellChargeDuration)
    function GetSpellChargeDuration(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): LuaDurationObject?
    --- Returns a table of info about the charges of a charge-accumulating spell; May return nil if spell is not found or is not charge-based
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellCharges)
    function GetSpellCharges(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): SpellChargeInfo?
    --- Returns the cooldown info of a spell.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `spellCooldownInfo`: Returns nil if spell is not found
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellCooldown)
    function GetSpellCooldown(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): SpellCooldownInfo?
    --- Returns a duration object describing the active cooldown duration for a spell.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellCooldownDuration)
    function GetSpellCooldownDuration(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier, ignoreGCD: boolean?): LuaDurationObject?
    --- Returns nil if spell is not found
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `description`: May be empty if spell's data isn't loaded yet; Listen for `SPELL_TEXT_UPDATE` event, or use SpellMixin to load asynchronously
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellDescription)
    function GetSpellDescription(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): string?
    --- Depending on the spell, return a string that is either the use count or number of charges. If value is beyond the display count parameter, returns the replacementString (defaults to '*').
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellDisplayCount)
    function GetSpellDisplayCount(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier, maxDisplayCount: number?, replacementString: string?): string
    --- Returns the spell ID for a given SpellIdentifier.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellIdentifier`: Using name will always check for an override on that spell; If passed a spell ID, will return same id as was passed
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellIDForSpellIdentifier)
    function GetSpellIDForSpellIdentifier(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): number?
    --- Returns spell info.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellIdentifier`: Using name will always check for an override on that spell
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `spellInfo`: Returns nil if spell is not found
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellInfo)
    function GetSpellInfo(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): SpellInfo?
    --- Returns the level the spell is learned at; May return a different value if the player is currently Level Linked with another player
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellLevelLearned)
    function GetSpellLevelLearned(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): number
    --- Returns the hyperlink for a spell.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `spellLink`: : spellLink - Returns nil if spell is not found
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellLink)
    function GetSpellLink(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier, glyphID: number?): string?
    --- Returns a duration object describing the active loss of control cooldown duration for a spell.
