    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellLossOfControlCooldownDuration)
    function GetSpellLossOfControlCooldownDuration(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): LuaDurationObject?
    --- Returns nil if spell is not found
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellLossOfControlCooldownInfo)
    function GetSpellLossOfControlCooldownInfo(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): SpellLossOfControlInfo?
    --- Returns the maximum number of stacks of the given spell's aura.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellMaxCumulativeAuraApplications)
    function GetSpellMaxCumulativeAuraApplications(spellID: SpellIdentifier): number
    --- Returns nil if spell is not found
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellName)
    function GetSpellName(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): string?
    --- Returns a table containing one or more SpellPowerCostInfos, one for each power type this spell costs
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `powerCosts`: May return nil if spell is not found or has no resource costs
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellPowerCost)
    function GetSpellPowerCost(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): SpellPowerCostInfo[]?
    --- Returns the spell queue window in milliseconds, from the `SpellQueueWindow` setting.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellQueueWindow)
    function GetSpellQueueWindow(): number
    --- Returns the rank of a spell that corresponds to an ability within a ranked SkillLine (ex: a crafting Recipe); Returns nil if spell is not found, or isn't part of a ranked SkillLine
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellSkillLineAbilityRank)
    function GetSpellSkillLineAbilityRank(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): number?
    --- Returns nil if spell is not found
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `subtext`: The text below the name in the SpellBook. Can contain values such as "Rank 2", "Passive" or "Racial Passive". May be empty if spell's data isn't loaded yet; Listen for `SPELL_TEXT_UPDATE` event, or use SpellMixin to load asynchronously
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetSpellSubtext)
    function GetSpellSubtext(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): string?
