    function GetSpellTexture(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): (number?, number?)
    --- Returns how the given spell's aura is shown: whether it has custom visibility, whether the player's own is always shown, and whether it is shown for the player's specialization.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `visibilityType`: The context the aura is shown in.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.GetVisibilityInfo)
    function GetVisibilityInfo(spellID: number, visibilityType: SpellAuraVisibilityType): (boolean?, boolean?, boolean?)
    --- Returns true if the spell is the player's melee Auto Attack spell
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsAutoAttackSpell)
    function IsAutoAttackSpell(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
