    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsAutoRepeatSpell)
    function IsAutoRepeatSpell(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Whether the given spell consumes an item or reagent.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellIdentifier`: The spell's ID or name.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsConsumableSpell)
    function IsConsumableSpell(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if the spell is currently being cast or is queued to be cast
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsCurrentSpell)
    function IsCurrentSpell(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if an aura is considered an external defensive.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsExternalDefensive)
    function IsExternalDefensive(spellID: number): boolean
    --- Returns true if the spell is an 'empower' type spell that is cast by pressing and holding, with the on-release cast typically being affected by time held
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsPressHoldReleaseSpell)
    function IsPressHoldReleaseSpell(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if an aura is considered high priority and should be ordered ahead of other auras in the UI.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsPriorityAura)
    function IsPriorityAura(spellID: number): boolean
    --- Returns true if the spell is the player's ranged Auto Attack spell (ex: Shoot, Auto Shot, etc)
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsRangedAutoAttackSpell)
    function IsRangedAutoAttackSpell(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if an aura only applies effects to the player, and no other units.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSelfBuff)
    function IsSelfBuff(spellID: number): boolean
    --- Returns true if the spell causes a crowd control effect when cast on a valid target.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSpellCrowdControl)
    function IsSpellCrowdControl(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if data for the spell has already been loaded and cached this session
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSpellDataCached)
    function IsSpellDataCached(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if the spell can be cast on hostile targets
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSpellHarmful)
    function IsSpellHarmful(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if the spell can be cast on the player or other friendly targets
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSpellHelpful)
    function IsSpellHelpful(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if the spell is considered important. For example a spell that's lethal if not interrupted would be considered important.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSpellImportant)
    function IsSpellImportant(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns true if the current target is within range of the spell; False if out of range; Nil if range check was invalid
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `targetUnit`: Optional specific target; If not supplied, player's current target (if any) will be used
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `inRange`: May be nil if the range check was invalid, ie due to unknown/invalid spell, missing/invalid target, etc
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSpellInRange)
    function IsSpellInRange(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier, targetUnit: string?): boolean?
    --- Whether the given spell is passive.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellIdentifier`: The spell's ID or name.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSpellPassive)
    function IsSpellPassive(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Returns whether the spell is currently castable.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellIdentifier`: Spell ID, name, name(subtext), or link
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `isUsable`: True if the spell is usable, false otherwise
    --- - `insufficientPower`: True if spell is specifically unusable due to insufficient power (i.e. MANA, RAGE, etc)
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.IsSpellUsable)
    function IsSpellUsable(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): (boolean, boolean)
