    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `spellIdentifier`: The spell's ID or name.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.PickupSpell)
    function PickupSpell(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier)
    --- Requests spell data and fires `SPELL_DATA_LOAD_RESULT`.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.RequestLoadSpellData)
    function RequestLoadSpellData(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier)
    --- Returns true if the spell has a min and/or max range greater than 0
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.SpellHasRange)
    function SpellHasRange(spellIdentifier: SpellIdentifier): boolean
    --- Whether the spell waiting for a target is an enchantment.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.TargetSpellIsEnchanting)
    function TargetSpellIsEnchanting(): boolean
    --- Whether the spell waiting for a target moves an item to another upgrade track.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.TargetSpellJumpsUpgradeTrack)
    function TargetSpellJumpsUpgradeTrack(): boolean
    --- Whether the spell waiting for a target replaces an item's bonus tree.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_Spell.TargetSpellReplacesBonusTree)
    function TargetSpellReplacesBonusTree(): boolean
end

